ksnip-pyqt6 (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of the PyQt6 port of ksnip.
  * Capture modes: rectangular area, last area, all screens, current screen,
    active window, window under the cursor and desktop portal.
  * Annotation editor with tabs, undo/redo, per-item rotation, stickers,
    watermark, spell checking and OCR.
  * Export to PNG, JPEG, BMP, TIFF and SVG, clipboard, printing and
    configurable upload scripts.

 -- wachin <wachin.id@gmail.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:38:53 -0500
